</div></div></div><div id="country_menu_sticky_wrapper" style="margin-top:2px;"><div class="container-fluid" style="background-color:#E9E9E9;"><div class="container" style="background-color:#E9E9E9;"><style>#country_menu_container > a > div.country_menu_hover, #country_menu_container > div.country_menu_hover { width: 12.5% !important; }</style><div class="scroll-menu-wrapper"><button id="country_menu_left_arrow" class="scroll-arrow scroll-arrow-left" onclick="scrollMenu('country_menu_container', 'left')"><i class="fas fa-chevron-left"></i></button><div class="row" id="country_menu_container" style=""><a href="/australia" style="" target="_self"><div class="col-md-2 country_menu_hover country_menu_selected" style="">About</div></a><a href="/national-symbols/australia" target="_self"><div class="col-md-2 country_menu_hover">National Symbols</div></a><a href="/currency/australia" target="_self"><div class="col-md-2 country_menu_hover">Currency</div></a><a href="/map/australia" target="_self"><div class="col-md-2 country_menu_hover">Map</div></a><a href="/nearby-countries/australia" target="_self"><div class="col-md-2 country_menu_hover">Nearby Countries</div></a><a href="/states/australia" target="_self"><div class="col-md-2 country_menu_hover">States</div></a><a href="/travel/australia" target="_self"><div class="col-md-2 country_menu_hover">Travel</div></a><div class="col-md-2 country_menu_hover country_menu_more_wrap" style="">More&nbsp;<i class="fas fa-caret-down" style="font-size:11px;"></i><div class="country_menu_more_dropdown"><a href="/holidays/australia" target="_self"><div class="country_menu_more_item">Holidays</div></a><a href="/sunrise-sunset/australia" target="_self"><div class="country_menu_more_item">Sunrise &amp; Sunset</div></a><a href="/lang/australia" target="_self"><div class="country_menu_more_item">Languages</div></a></div></div></div><button id="country_menu_right_arrow" class="scroll-arrow scroll-arrow-right" onclick="scrollMenu('country_menu_container', 'right')"><i class="fas fa-chevron-right"></i></button></div></div></div></div><div class="container" style=""><div class="row" style="margin-bottom:10px;"><div class="col-md-9"><div class="row" style="margin-bottom:10px;"><div class="country-page-heading"><h3>&#127758; Australia - Profile & Geographic Data</h3></div><hr class="country-page-head-line"></div><div class="row" style=""><div style="background: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px 20px;"><p style="color: #1a237e; margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; text-align: justify;">Discover comprehensive <strong>geographic, demographic and strategic intelligence</strong> for <strong>Australia</strong>, featuring detailed insights into <strong>population statistics, territorial measurements, economic indicators, timezone data</strong> and <strong>geopolitical positioning</strong>. This authoritative country profile serves business professionals, market researchers, location analysts and strategic planners requiring accurate Australia data for commercial decision-making.</p><p style="color: #1a237e; margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; text-align: justify;"><strong>Benefits for Professionals:</strong> Hourly-updated current date & time &#9670; Accurate territorial statistics &#9670; Global population rankings &#9670; Currency conversion data &#9670; Geographic coordinate systems &#9670; Mobile-optimized access &#9670; Strategic location insights &#9670; Business intelligence &#9670; Market research foundation for <a href="/currency-converter/" style="color: #1a237e; text-decoration: underline;">currency exchange analysis</a>, planning international operations and researching <a href="/countries" style="color: #1a237e; text-decoration: underline;">comparative country data</a></p></div></div><div class="row" style="margin-bottom:10px;"><div style="font-weight: bold;color:#4CAF50;"><h3 style="font-size: 22px;">Australia Geographic & Demographic Overview</h3></div><hr style="border-width:1px; border-color:#CCCCCC; margin:1px;"></div><div class="table-responsive" style="webkit-box-shadow: 0px 0px 5px 0px rgba(204,204,204,1);-moz-box-shadow: 0px 0px 5px 0px rgba(204,204,204,1);box-shadow: 0px 0px 5px 0px rgba(204,204,204,1);"><table class="table table-bordered table-hover" style="margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#2c3e50;font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;"><thead style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);"><tr style="font-size:17px;font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:600;background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); color: white;"><th style="vertical-align: middle; padding: 14px; border-right: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); text-align: center;">Category</th><th style="vertical-align: middle; padding: 14px; border-right: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); text-align: center;">Attribute</th><th style="vertical-align: middle; padding: 14px; text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); text-align: center;">Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td rowspan="5" style="width:20%;vertical-align:middle;text-align:left;font-weight:600;background-color:#f8f9fa;">Country</td></tr><tr><td style="width:27%;text-align:left;">Full Name</td><td style="text-align:left;">Australia</td></tr><tr><td style="width:27%;text-align:left;">Short Name</td><td style="text-align:left;">AUS </td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;">National Capital</td><td style="text-align:left;"><a href="/australia/australian-capital-territory/canberra" style="color:#1565C0;text-decoration:none;font-weight:500;" onmouseover="this.style.textDecoration='underline'" onmouseout="this.style.textDecoration='none'">Canberra</a></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;">Continent</td><td style="text-align:left;">Australia And Oceania</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="4" style="width:20%;vertical-align:middle;text-align:left;font-weight:600;background-color:#f8f9fa;">Population</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;">Total Population</td><td style="text-align:left;">26,643,745</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;">Density per km<sup>2</sup> (mi<sup>2</sup>) </td><td style="text-align:left;">3.49 (9.04)</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;">Percentage In World Population</td><td style="text-align:left;">0.33%</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="7" style="width:20%;vertical-align:middle;text-align:left;font-weight:600;background-color:#f8f9fa;">Area</td></tr><tr><td>Land Area In km<sup>2</sup> (mi<sup>2</sup>)</td><td>7,633,560 (2,947,333)</td></tr><tr><td>% In World Land Area</td><td style="">5.90%</td></tr><tr><td>Water Area In km<sup>2</sup> (mi<sup>2</sup>)</td><td>58,459 (22,571)</td></tr><tr><td>% In World Water Area</td><td style="">1.38%</td></tr><tr><td>Total Area In km<sup>2</sup> (mi<sup>2</sup>)</td><td>7,692,019 (2,969,904)</td></tr><tr><td>% In World Total Area</td><td style="">5.75%</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="5" style="width:20%;vertical-align:middle;text-align:left;font-weight:600;background-color:#f8f9fa;">Ranking &amp; Classification</td></tr><tr><td>Political Status</td><td>Independent Country</td></tr><tr><td>Area Rank in World</td><td>Rank #6 <a href="/country/area" style="color:#1565C0;font-size:12px;margin-left:6px;">&#8250; View area rankings</a></td></tr><tr><td>Population Rank in World</td><td>#55 of 249 countries</td></tr><tr><td>Population Rank in Australia And Oceania</td><td>#1 of 28 countries</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="4" style="width:27%;vertical-align:middle;font-weight:600;background-color:#f8f9fa;">Currency</td></tr><tr><td>Name</td><td>Australian Dollar</td></tr><tr><td>Code ISO-4217</td><td>AUD</td></tr><tr><td>Symbol</td><td>$</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="width:27%;vertical-align:middle;font-weight:600;background-color:#f8f9fa;">Language</td></tr><tr><td>National and Official Languages</td><td>English</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="width:27%;vertical-align:middle;font-weight:600;backgr